    verification: 'La campaña quedó cerrada con el 100% del alcance revisado (o los rezagados escalados y resueltos), las revocaciones con su remediación completada en las fuentes/apps (cola vacía o con dueño y fecha), ningún revisor sin certificación activa, y el reporte final exportado con % de respuesta, decisiones y remediación archivado como evidencia del trimestre (insumo de RB-IAM-022).',
    evidence_to_collect: [
      'Matriz de alcance aprobada (poblaciones críticas primero) y fecha dura de la campaña',
      'Avance por certificación con los escalamientos enviados (fechas, destinatarios y resultado)',
      'Reporte de cierre: % de respuesta, decisiones approve/revoke y estado de la remediación',
      'Export de las certificaciones y reasignaciones documentadas, firmado por el líder de IAM',
    ],
    escalation: 'Revisores que tras el escalamiento siguen sin responder: decisión del líder de IAM con el dueño del área — por defecto, lo que nadie certifica se revoca al cierre (la campaña no se cierra con "approve all"). Hallazgos de acceso privilegiado sin dueño o sin justificación dentro de la campaña: incidente de gobernanza al líder de IAM y CISO el mismo día (espejo de RB-IAM-015/016).',
    english_customer_response_template: 'Hello, the quarterly access certification campaign under ticket {{TICKET_ID}} has been executed in SailPoint IdentityNow. The campaign covered the approved scope prioritizing privileged, external, and business-critical access; reviewers received their certifications with a hard deadline, and non-responders were escalated mid-campaign to their managers. Every revoked item was tracked through the remediation queue until the access was actually removed at the source, and the final campaign report (scope, response rate, decisions, revocations, and remediation status) was exported and archived as audit evidence. The campaign is closed with no unreviewed access left behind.',
    english_technical_explanation: 'Quarterly certification campaign executed in SailPoint IdentityNow at {{TIMESTAMP}} for tenant {{TENANT}}: OAuth2 client-credentials token obtained from the oauth/token endpoint, source freshness validated via /v3/sources before campaign creation, campaign created via POST /v3/campaigns (name AR-2025-Q4, manager type per the approved scope matrix) and activated with a hard deadline announced to reviewers. Progress monitored per certification via /beta/certifications with mid-cycle escalation to laggard reviewers and formal reassignment of orphaned certifications. Revoke decisions tracked through the remediation queue until removal was confirmed at the source application. Campaign closed with the final report exported (scope, response rate, decisions, remediation status) and archived for audit as input to the quarterly evidence pack.',
    keywords: ['sailpoint', 'identitynow', 'isc', 'campana', 'campaign', 'certificacion', 'certification', 'access review', 'access certification', 'revisores', 'reviewers', 'revocacion', 'remediacion', 'remediation', 'ar-2025', 'v3/campaigns', 'beta/certifications', 'fecha dura'],
